{"index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><base href=\"/admin/\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>WordPress Studio · Independent Grocery Builder</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/shared.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></head><body><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Connecting to the WordPress authentication service…</strong><p>This workspace has its own Neon account and database.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-wp-templates-page\" tabindex=\"-1\"><header class=\"page-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">INDEPENDENT WORDPRESS WORKSPACE</p><h1>Grocery Builder</h1><p>Manage storefront designs, page content and customer orders from this separate application.</p></div></header><section class=\"hf-wpt-detail-grid\"><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Storefront templates</h2><p>Choose one of four independent grocery storefront designs and customize its pages.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=ecommerce-grocery&amp;template=1\">Open templates ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website pages</h2><p>Manage the 25-page website structure and persistent page drafts.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/website-pages.html?template=general-supermarket\">Manage pages ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website orders</h2><p>Review customer orders and update supported fulfilment statuses.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/website-orders.html?template=general-supermarket\">Open orders ↗</a></article></section></main></div><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-client.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-auth.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script></body></html>","robots.txt":"User-agent: *\nAllow: /\n","admin/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><base href=\"/admin/\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>WordPress Studio · Independent Grocery Builder</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/shared.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></head><body><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Connecting to the WordPress authentication service…</strong><p>This workspace has its own Neon account and database.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-wp-templates-page\" tabindex=\"-1\"><header class=\"page-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">INDEPENDENT WORDPRESS WORKSPACE</p><h1>Grocery Builder</h1><p>Manage storefront designs, page content and customer orders from this separate application.</p></div></header><section class=\"hf-wpt-detail-grid\"><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Storefront templates</h2><p>Choose one of four independent grocery storefront designs and customize its pages.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=ecommerce-grocery&amp;template=1\">Open templates ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website pages</h2><p>Manage the 25-page website structure and persistent page drafts.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/website-pages.html?template=general-supermarket\">Manage pages ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Website orders</h2><p>Review customer orders and update supported fulfilment statuses.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/website-orders.html?template=general-supermarket\">Open orders ↗</a></article><article class=\"hf-card hf-card-pad\"><h2>Central Commerce</h2><p>Manage products, stock, orders, customers, suppliers, purchasing, delivery and finance for all four storefronts in one workspace.</p><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" href=\"/admin/commerce.html\">Open Central Commerce ↗</a></article></section></main></div><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-client.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-auth.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script></body></html>","admin/wordpress-templates.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Business Templates · WordPress Studio</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/shared.css?v=fitness-gym-20261109-v1\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=fitness-gym-20261109-v1\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wordpress-templates.css?v=professional-services-20261109-v1\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?v=fitness-gym-20261109-v1\">\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"wordpress-templates\">\n<div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>This private template library is available only to the authorized admin account.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-wp-templates-page\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<header class=\"page-heading hf-wpt-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">WORDPRESS · COMMERCE TEMPLATE STUDIO</p><h1 id=\"wpTemplateCategoryTitle\">Business Templates</h1><p id=\"wpTemplateIntro\">Loading the selected industry templates…</p></div><div class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"hf-button hf-button-primary\" href=\"/admin/commerce.html\">Central Commerce ↗</a><a class=\"hf-button hf-button-secondary\" href=\"/admin/wordpress-live.html\">← Back to WordPress</a></div></header>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-architecture\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-architecture-mark\">WP</div><div><strong>WordPress Builder Commerce Template System</strong><p>GitHub is the version-controlled source for storefront designs and editor code. Neon is the data layer for template catalog, website configuration, products, categories, assets and orders. Preview content is illustrative until a merchant connects their own catalog.</p></div><span class=\"hf-wpt-connection\" id=\"wpTemplateConnection\">CONNECTING TO NEON</span></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-template-bar\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-template-bar-copy\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-eyebrow\">STOREFRONT COLLECTION</span><strong>Choose a design direction</strong></div><nav class=\"hf-wpt-template-tabs\" id=\"wpTemplateTabs\" aria-label=\"Storefront templates\" hidden></nav></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-preview-shell\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-toolbar\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-meta\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-live-dot\"></span><div><strong id=\"wpTemplateName\">Loading selected template…</strong><small id=\"wpTemplateTagline\">Preparing its website preview</small></div></div><div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-actions\"><div class=\"hf-wpt-device-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Preview size\"><button type=\"button\" data-preview-device=\"desktop\" class=\"is-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">▰ <span>Desktop</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-preview-device=\"mobile\" aria-pressed=\"false\">▯ <span>Mobile</span></button></div><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplatePages\" href=\"/admin/website-pages.html\">Explore 36 pages ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplateUse\" href=\"/admin/website-builder.html\">Customize design ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button hf-wpt-browser-button\" id=\"wpTemplateBrowserTop\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See Website with Browser ↗</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"hf-wpt-browserbar\"><span class=\"hf-wpt-browser-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"hf-wpt-lock\">▣</span><span class=\"hf-wpt-browser-address\" id=\"wpTemplateAddress\">preview://loading-selected-template</span><span class=\"hf-wpt-browser-label\">PREVIEW</span></div>\n<div class=\"hf-wpt-viewport is-desktop\" id=\"wpTemplateViewport\"><div class=\"hf-storefront\" id=\"wpStorefront\" data-template=\"\" hidden><div style=\"padding:48px;text-align:center\">Loading selected website preview…</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"hf-wpt-preview-footer\"><span>Interactive storefront concept · sample products and prices only</span><span id=\"wpTemplateFeatureSummary\">Quick add · sticky cart · fast local delivery</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-detail-grid\" id=\"wpTemplateDetails\"><article><small>DESIGN APPROACH</small><h3>Compact product cards · quick-add flows</h3><p>A compact, high-velocity convenience experience with instant add controls, short category rails, reorder shortcuts and a persistent cart for quick local delivery.</p></article><article><small>BEST FOR</small><h3>Quick commerce</h3><p>Convenience stores, express grocery and local delivery shops</p></article><article><small>COMMERCE FEATURES</small><ul><li>Compact, scan-friendly catalogue</li><li>One-tap quick add</li><li>Sticky basket and quantity controls</li><li>Repeat-order shortcuts</li><li>Delivery-zone messaging</li></ul></article></section>\n<section class=\"hf-wpt-next-step\"><div><span class=\"hf-wpt-eyebrow\">NEXT STEP</span><h2>Make this storefront yours</h2><p>Open the visual editor with this design direction selected. Your working draft is isolated from every other storefront until you choose to publish it.</p></div><div class=\"hf-wpt-bottom-actions\"><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplatePagesBottom\" href=\"/admin/website-pages.html\">Manage all 36 pages ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button\" id=\"wpTemplateUseBottom\" href=\"/admin/website-builder.html\">Open in Website Builder ↗</a><a class=\"hf-wpt-use-button hf-wpt-browser-button\" id=\"wpTemplateBrowserBottom\" href=\"/storefront.html?site=hf-express-grocery&amp;preview=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See Website with Browser ↗</a></div></section>\n</main></div>\n\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-client.js?v=fitness-gym-20261109-v1\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-auth.js?v=fitness-gym-20261109-v1\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=professional-services-20261109-v1\"></script>\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/wordpress-templates.js?v=professional-services-20261109-v1\"></script>\n</body></html>","admin/website-pages.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>Website Pages · WordPress Workspace</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/shared.css?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/website-pages.css?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?v=beauty-salon-20261109\">\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"wordpress\"><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>Website pages are available only to the authorized admin account.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" class=\"hf-pages-page\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<header class=\"hf-pages-header\"><div><span class=\"hf-pages-kicker\">MULTI-PAGE STORE BUILDER</span><h1 id=\"hfPagesTitle\">Website Pages</h1><p id=\"hfPagesIntro\">Manage the complete page structure for the selected template, with editable content and connected navigation.</p></div><div class=\"hf-pages-actions\"><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" href=\"/admin/commerce.html\">Central Commerce ↗</a><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" id=\"hfOrdersLink\" href=\"/admin/website-orders.html?template=general-supermarket\">View orders</a><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" href=\"/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=ecommerce-grocery\">Template library</a><a class=\"hf-pages-btn secondary\" id=\"hfPagesPreview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Preview website ↗</a><button class=\"hf-pages-btn\" id=\"hfPublishSite\" type=\"button\">Publish website</button></div></header>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-status\" id=\"hfPagesStatus\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Connecting to Neon…</section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-stats\" id=\"hfPagesStats\"></section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-onboarding\" id=\"hfPagesOnboarding\"></section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-section\"><div class=\"hf-pages-section-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-pages-kicker\">DESIGNED PAGE LIBRARY</span><h2>Core website pages</h2><p>25 page designs are included in each theme. Product and category pages are connected to the live catalogue.</p></div><span class=\"hf-pages-count\" id=\"hfCorePageCount\">25 PAGES</span></div><div class=\"hf-pages-grid\" id=\"hfCorePages\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"hf-pages-section\"><div class=\"hf-pages-section-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-pages-kicker\">GROW YOUR WEBSITE</span><h2>Custom pages</h2><p>Create more pages for campaigns, policies, guides and stories.</p></div></div><form class=\"hf-pages-custom\" id=\"hfCustomPageForm\"><label for=\"hfCustomPageTitle\">New page title</label><input id=\"hfCustomPageTitle\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"e.g. Our Sourcing Standards\" required=\"\"><button class=\"hf-pages-btn\" type=\"submit\">Add page +</button></form><div class=\"hf-pages-grid\" id=\"hfCustomPages\"></div></section>\n<footer class=\"hf-pages-footer\">GitHub stores the storefront renderer and theme design. Neon stores each website, its 25 page documents, catalogue and customer orders. Preview is private; publish is a separate action.</footer>\n</main></div>\n\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-client.js?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-auth.js?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=professional-services-20261109-v1\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/website-pages.js?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"></script>\n</body></html>","admin/website-orders.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Website Orders · WordPress Workspace</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/shared.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/website-orders.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\">\n</head><body data-page=\"wordpress\"><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>Only the authorized website owner can view these orders.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main class=\"hf-orders-page\" id=\"pageContent\" tabindex=\"-1\"><header class=\"hf-orders-head\"><div><span class=\"hf-orders-kicker\">NEON COMMERCE · PRIVATE ADMIN</span><h1 id=\"hfOrdersTitle\">Website Orders</h1><p>Orders placed through this storefront. Customer information is visible only to the website owner.</p></div><div class=\"hf-orders-actions\"><a class=\"hf-orders-btn secondary\" href=\"/admin/commerce.html\">Central Commerce ↗</a><a class=\"hf-orders-btn secondary\" id=\"hfBackPages\">Website pages</a><a class=\"hf-orders-btn secondary\" id=\"hfPublicSite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Storefront ↗</a></div></header><div id=\"hfOrdersStatus\" class=\"hf-orders-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Connecting to Neon…</div><section class=\"hf-orders-summary\" id=\"hfOrdersSummary\"></section><section class=\"hf-orders-tools\"><input id=\"hfOrdersSearch\" type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search orders by order number, customer or phone\" placeholder=\"Search order, customer or phone…\"><select id=\"hfOrdersFilter\" aria-label=\"Filter orders by status\"><option value=\"all\">All statuses</option><option value=\"pending\">Pending</option><option value=\"processing\">Processing</option><option value=\"shipped\">Shipped</option><option value=\"delivered\">Delivered</option><option value=\"cancelled\">Cancelled</option></select><button id=\"hfOrdersRefresh\" class=\"hf-orders-btn\" type=\"button\">Refresh</button></section><section id=\"hfOrdersList\" class=\"hf-orders-list\"></section></main></div>\n<script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-client.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-auth.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=beauty-salon-20261109\"></script><script defer=\"\" src=\"/admin/website-orders.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script></body></html>","admin/wordpress-live.html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>Live Websites · WordPress Studio</title><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/\" crossorigin><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/shared.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wordpress.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/workspace-global-theme.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/admin/wp-admin-shell.css?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></head><body data-page=\"wordpress-live\"><div id=\"authGate\" class=\"auth-gate\"><div class=\"auth-gate-card\"><strong>Checking secure admin access…</strong><p>Your published websites are available only to the authorized owner account.</p></div></div><div id=\"adminApp\"><main id=\"pageContent\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"hf-wordpress-page hf-live-sites-page\"><header class=\"page-heading hf-wordpress-heading\"><div><p class=\"page-eyebrow\">PUBLISHING · NEON LIVE WEBSITE REGISTER</p><h1>Live Websites</h1><p>Public website status, saved page count and working storefront links from your independent Neon workspace.</p></div><div class=\"page-actions\"><a class=\"hf-button hf-button-secondary\" href=\"/admin/wordpress-templates.html?category=hospital-healthcare\">Template Library ↗</a><button class=\"hf-button hf-button-primary\" id=\"wpLiveRefresh\" type=\"button\">↻ Refresh websites</button></div></header><section class=\"hf-live-sites-summary\" id=\"wpLiveSummary\"><article><span>Published websites</span><strong id=\"wpLivePublishedCount\">—</strong></article><article><span>Draft websites</span><strong id=\"wpLiveDraftCount\">—</strong></article><article><span>Template showcases</span><strong id=\"wpLiveShowcaseCount\">—</strong></article></section><section class=\"hf-live-sites-toolbar\"><div><strong>Your website portfolio</strong><p>Open the public site, edit its saved pages or manage its catalogue.</p></div><label for=\"wpLiveCategoryFilter\">Category <select id=\"wpLiveCategoryFilter\"><option value=\"\">All categories</option><option value=\"hospital-healthcare\">Hospital &amp; Healthcare</option><option value=\"real-estate-property\">Real Estate &amp; Property</option><option value=\"medicine-pharmacy\">Medicine &amp; Pharmacy</option><option value=\"beauty-salon\">Beauty &amp; Salon</option></select></label></section><p class=\"hf-live-sites-status\" id=\"wpLiveStatus\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Connecting to Neon…</p><section class=\"hf-live-sites-grid\" id=\"wpLiveSitesGrid\"><article class=\"hf-live-sites-empty\">Loading your website register…</article></section><footer class=\"hf-live-sites-foot\"><span>Website status is read directly from Neon.</span><span>Showcase sites are public design previews; real commerce requires verified products, policies and fulfilment settings.</span></footer></main></div><script defer src=\"/admin/neon-client.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script><script defer src=\"/admin/neon-auth.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script><script defer src=\"/admin/neon-builder-api.js?v=professional-services-20261109-v1\"></script><script defer src=\"/admin/wordpress-live.js?v=restaurant-food-20261108\"></script></body></html>"}